Toolbox Enhanced, a companion to dsh-toolbox-ui.
Upstream: https://github.com/Imzl-zl/dsh-toolbox-ui
Originally adapted from 1.12.0, commit fc75df39fcb2df31e8a5f9d7d05158595aaab07a.
Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-toolbox-ui contributors. MIT license retained in LICENSE.
The community bundle remains the single implementation of management services,
RPC, original components and update checking. This package decorates registered
React output and retains native-shell.css and the existing local tool policy.
A small native-config-editor adapter preserves existing startupTimeoutMs on edits
and export while upstream 1.12.0 does not handle this field.
